  faqs: [
    {
      "q": "Where is my project tracker data stored?",
      "a": "On your own machine. The file-based tracker writes to a JSON file you choose; the browser tracker writes to the browser's local storage. Nothing is sent to the TronKits server."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which browsers support the file-based tracker?",
      "a": "Browsers that support the File System Access API, currently Chrome and Edge on desktop. Use the browser tracker in Firefox, Safari or on a phone."
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I sync projects between computers?",
      "a": "Use the file-based tracker and keep its JSON file in a synced folder such as Dropbox, OneDrive or iCloud Drive, then open the same file on each computer."
